{"sha": "5fd399f36da141d295457e1464dccd64ec6a98d532c744ccba4bf488dd6808a1", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "常系数线性方程的特征方程（数学课程中的二阶线性方程）：", "其根为", "$r = -\\omega_0/2Q \\pm \\tfrac12\\sqrt\\Delta$。当 $Q > \\tfrac12$ 时，", "$\\sqrt\\Delta = \\iu\\omega_0\\sqrt{4 - 1/Q^2}$，于是实部为", "$-\\omega_0/2Q = -1/\\tau$，虚部为 $\\pm\\omega_0\\sqrt{1 - 1/4Q^2}$；", "实解即 $\\eu^{-t/\\tau}\\cos\\omega t$ 与", "$\\eu^{-t/\\tau}\\sin\\omega t$ 的线性组合。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=11.5cm, height=6cm, xlabel={$\\omega_0 t$}, ylabel={$x/x_\\infty$},", "    xmin=0, xmax=16, ymin=0, ymax=1.75, xtick={0,5,10,15}, ytick={0.5,1,1.5},", "    legend style={at={(0.97,0.97)}, anchor=north east, font=\\footnotesize, draw=none, fill=none}]", "  % Q=0.2: roots r = -(1/(2Q))(1 -/+ sqrt(1-4Q^2)) = -2.5(1 -/+ 0.6) = -1, -4 ; x = 1 - (4 e^{-t} - e^{-4t})/3", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=0:16, samples=200] {1 - (4*exp(-x) - exp(-4*x))/3};", "  \\addlegendentry{$Q = 0.2$（非周期的）}", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:16, samples=200] {1 - (1 + x)*exp(-x)};", "  \\addlegendentry{$Q = 0.5$（临界）}", "  % Q=3: tau=6, w = sqrt(1-1/36)=0.986 ; x = 1 - e^{-t/6}(cos wt + sin wt /(6 w))", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:16, samples=400] {1 - exp(-x/6)*(cos(deg(0.986*x)) + sin(deg(0.986*x))/(6*0.986))};", "  \\addlegendentry{$Q = 3$（准周期的）}", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, domain=0:16, samples=2] {1};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 二阶系统从静止出发的阶跃响应，对三个不同的", "品质因数：$Q$ 较小时为缓慢爬升；$Q = \\tfrac12$ 时为无超调的最快回归；", "$Q$ 较大时出现振铃，持续约 $Q$ 次", "振荡。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[由准周期曲线读出 $Q$]\\label{prop:b1:transient-regimes:decrement}", "\\index{对数衰减率}", "在准周期情形下，相邻两个极大值之比为", "$x_{n+1}/x_n = \\eu^{-T/\\tau}$；\\emph{对数衰减率}定义为", "\\[", "\\delta = \\ln\\frac{x_n}{x_{n+1}} = \\frac{T}{\\tau} = \\frac{\\pi}{Q\\sqrt{1 - 1/4Q^2}}", "\\approx \\frac{\\pi}{Q} \\quad (Q \\gg 1)", "\\]", "由此给出 $Q$；可见振荡的次数，", "即振幅降至 $5\\%$ 以下之前，约为 $Q$。当 $Q \\gg 1$ 时，$\\omega \\approx \\omega_0$", "且 $T \\approx 2\\pi/\\omega_0$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "包络 $\\eu^{-t/\\tau}$ 每周期乘以 $\\eu^{-T/\\tau}$；", "$T/\\tau = (2\\pi/\\omega)(\\omega_0/2Q)$。包络在 $\\eu^{-3}", "\\approx 5\\%$ 时，即 $3\\tau = 6Q/\\omega_0 \\approx Q\\,T$，", "约经过 $Q$ 个周期。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=11.5cm, height=5.6cm, xlabel={$t$}, ylabel={$x$},", "    xmin=0, xmax=12.5, ymin=-1.2, ymax=1.3, xtick={2,4,6,8,10,12},", "    xticklabels={$T$,$2T$,$3T$,$4T$,$5T$,$6T$}, ytick={-1,1}, yticklabels={$-x_0$,$x_0$}]", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, domain=0:12.5, samples=60] {exp(-x/5)};", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, domain=0:12.5, samples=60] {-exp(-x/5)};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:12.5, samples=500] {exp(-x/5)*cos(deg(pi*x))};", "  \\fill[omThm] (axis cs:0,1) circle (1.4pt) node[above right, font=\\footnotesize] {$x_0$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (axis cs:2,0.670) circle (1.4pt) node[above right, xshift=2pt, yshift=3pt, font=\\footnotesize] {$x_1 = x_0\\eu^{-T/\\tau}$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (axis cs:4,0.449) circle (1.4pt) node[above right, xshift=2pt, yshift=3pt, font=\\footnotesize] {$x_2$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 自由准周期衰减，$x = x_0\\eu^{-t/\\tau}\\cos\\omega t$：", "相邻极大值按固定因子 $\\eu^{-T/\\tau}$ 减小，且", "$\\ln(x_n/x_{n+1}) = T/\\tau \\approx \\pi/Q$ 给出品质因数，", "可由曲线读出。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[RLC 电路的振铃]\\label{ex:b1:transient-regimes:rlcnum}", "$L = \\qty{10}{mH}$, $C = \\qty{100}{nF}$, $R = \\qty{100}{\\ohm}$:", "$\\omega_0 = 1/\\sqrt{10^{-9}} = \\qty{3.16e4}{rad/s}$ ($f_0 =", "\\qty{5.03}{kHz}$），$Q = \\sqrt{L/C}/R = 316/100 = 3.16$：准周期情形，", "$\\tau = 2Q/\\omega_0 = \\qty{0.20}{ms}$, $\\omega = 0.987\\,\\omega_0$,", "$T = \\qty{0.20}{ms}$，可见三次振荡。临界电阻", "为 $R_c = 2\\sqrt{L/C} = \\qty{632}{\\ohm}$，超过此值时放电", "为非周期的。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[二阶暂态的求解]\\label{met:b1:transient-regimes:second}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 写出方程；化为标准形式；读出 $\\omega_0$，", "        $Q$ 与 $x_\\infty$。", "  \\item 由 $Q$ 判定情形，并将通解写成", "        $x_\\infty$ 与齐次方程的解之和。", "  \\item 求 $x(0)$ 和 $x'(0)$，依据 $u_C$ 与 $i_L$ 的连续性；", "        （对 RLC 电路：$u_C(0^+) = u_C(0^-)$ 且 $u_C'(0^+) = i(0^-)/C$）；", "        解出两个常数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[初始条件]\\label{ex:b1:transient-regimes:ic}", "上例中的电容器充电至 $U_0$，并于", "$t = 0$ 时闭合开关，接到 $L$ 与 $R$ 上（无电源）：$x_\\infty = 0$，", "$u_C(0) = U_0$，$u_C'(0) = i(0)/C = 0$，因线圈中原无电流。", "由此得 $A = U_0$，且 $-A/\\tau + B\\omega = 0$，$B = U_0/(\\omega\\tau) =", "U_0/\\sqrt{4Q^2 - 1}$，于是 $u_C = U_0\\eu^{-t/\\tau}[\\cos\\omega t + \\sin(\\omega", "t)/\\sqrt{4Q^2 - 1}]$ --- 当 $Q \\gg 1$ 时简化为 $U_0\\eu^{-t/\\tau}\\cos\\omega_0 t$，", "而电流 $i = -C\\,\\dd u_C/\\dd t$ 的峰值约在 $U_0\\sqrt{C/L} =", "U_0/(\\omega_0 L)$ 附近。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{remark}[能量]\\label{rem:b1:transient-regimes:energy}", "储存能量 $\\tfrac12 Cu_C^2 + \\tfrac12 Li^2$（或 $\\tfrac12 kx^2", "+ \\tfrac12 m\\dot x^2$）以速率 $Ri^2$（$\\alpha\\dot x^2$）减少：", "对其求导并利用方程。每经过一个准周期，能量", "减为原来的 $\\eu^{-2T/\\tau}$ 倍；当 $Q = 3$ 时，每次振荡约", "损失其中的 $88\\%$。$Q$ 大意味着相对于振荡而言能量泄漏缓慢 ---", "是好的计时器，也是尖锐的共振", "（见\\cref{ch:b1:sinusoidal-impedance}） --- 而 $Q$ 小则回复迅速：", "宜用于悬挂装置或仪表指针。", "\\end{remark}", ""]}